Doma Result Generator - bundled runtime libraries

The update site redistributes the following Maven artifacts. Tycho adds OSGi
metadata to artifacts that do not already contain it; original library classes
and resources are retained. This does not make the plug-in an official Doma,
Eclipse, Apache or MojoHaus product.

* Gson 2.13.2 (com.google.code.gson:gson)
  Copyright Google Inc.
  https://github.com/google/gson
  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this plug-in)

* Doma-Gen 2.28.0 (org.seasar.doma:doma-gen)
  Copyright 2019 domaframework.org
  https://github.com/domaframework/doma-gen
  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this plug-in)

* Doma Core 2.57.0 (org.seasar.doma:doma-core)
  https://github.com/domaframework/doma
  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this plug-in)

* Apache FreeMarker 2.3.34 (org.freemarker:freemarker)
  https://freemarker.apache.org/
  Apache License 2.0; original license/attributions are in its META-INF/LICENSE.

* Apache Ant and Ant Launcher 1.10.18 (org.apache.ant:ant, ant-launcher)
  https://ant.apache.org/
  Apache License 2.0; original META-INF/LICENSE.txt and NOTICE.txt are retained.
  These satisfy doma-gen's library dependencies; no Ant task is launched.

* Animal Sniffer Annotations 1.9 (org.codehaus.mojo:animal-sniffer-annotations)
  https://github.com/mojohaus/animal-sniffer
